OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fwindy, with further spells of rain.
OL,7,FThis rain will often be light but with
OL,8,Fa risk of some heavier and more
OL,9,Fshowery pulses. Mild, but with the
OL,10,Fwarmth tempered by the wind.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FOn the cloudy side at first
OL,13,Fwith some rain or showers, clearing
OL,14,Fduring the morning to a bright and
OL,15,Fbreezy day with some warm sunny spells
OL,16,Fand perhaps isolated showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
