OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMore
OL,6,Fsettled than in recent days, still
OL,7,Fsome cloud around, but rain and winds
OL,8,Fgenerally becoming lighter, with
OL,9,Flengthier fine periods. Becoming
OL,10,Fwarmer, but some chilly starts likely
OL,11,Fat first.
